          "file": "catalog/search/highlight.py",
          "claim": "WHAT: page_of() computes start = page * per_page while its own docstring states page starts at 1, so page=1 returns results[20:40] and the first 20 results are never shown (and page=0 is needed to get the first page). WHY: every page from the UI is shifted by one, so the first page of search results is unreachable and the last page returns an empty list. HOW: use start = (page - 1) * per_page and guard page < 1.",
