          "rationale": "The docstring explicitly states page starts at 1, but the code computes start = page * per_page, so page=1 yields results[20:40] and the first 20 results are unreachable. This is a concrete off-by-one bug matching the claim; the prior decisions concern highlight offsets and CSV escaping, not pagination, so this is not a repeat.",
